  "description": {
    "text": "The Diamond & Pearl Trainer Kit, released on 24 September 2007 in English and European languages only, held two 30-card half decks, Lucario and Manaphy, with a booster pack, damage and status counters, a Manaphy coin and a playmat; it was also sold in a Trainer's Challenge Set with three Diamond & Pearl booster packs and a promo Shinx. The cards are reprints from Diamond & Pearl and Mysterious Treasures with the kit's own set symbol and number and no rarity mark; the holo Lucario and Manaphy have artwork different from their Diamond & Pearl cards.\n\nThe Manaphy half deck runs on Water Energy and holds twelve different cards, 1/12 to 12/12.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Diamond & Pearl Trainer Kit (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 4 September 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260904223627/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Diamond_%26_Pearl_Trainer_Kit_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "The Manaphy half-deck symbol, and a number out of 12",
    "sources": [
